{"articleNo":"146798","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=146798&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"산업용 기능성하이테크섬유분야 지원사업 안내(네트워킹 및 교육 무상지원)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.02.29","hit":"2057","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">가</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">사업 목적</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">ㅇ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">대구,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">경북,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">부산 지역 산업용 기능성하이테크섬유 관련기업의 매출</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">증대 및 일자리 창출</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">ㅇ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">기능성하이테크섬유산업 구조혁신을 통한 지역경제 활성화 및 기업 경쟁력 강화</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">나</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">사업기간 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2015. 05. 01 ~ 2016. 04. 30</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">지원 대상</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\">ㅇ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">사업자등록증 기준 소재지가 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FO